    <div>
      <p>
        © 1996–{year} <strong class="text-orww-ink font-medium">Oregon Websites and Watersheds Project, Inc.</strong> &amp; <strong class="text-orww-ink font-medium">NW Maps Co.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Continuously maintained since January 15, 1997.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:text-center">
      <p>
        Site by Dave Sullivan and the OASTL working group, built with Claude (Anthropic).
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        <a href="/colophon/" class="no-underline hover:underline">Colophon →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:text-right">
      <p>
        Canonical archive at <a href="http://www.orww.org/" class="no-underline hover:underline">www.orww.org</a>, maintained continuously since 1997.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        <a href="/reference-desk/" class="no-underline hover:underline">Reference Desk →</a>
